{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived at Töplitz this evening, lodging at the new inn under the sign of the King of Prussia. The heat was oppressive during the journey from Abersau, but the change of air here is already refreshing. I followed Fräulein Stok’s advice and climbed the Schlackenberg opposite the inn; the view is striking, though my legs are tired. I have drunk the waters in the Spitalgarten and walked in the park of Prince Clary’s castle. The air is cool, and the water bath (Steinbad) did wonders for my stiff joints. I dined well, and for once, I did not feel the need to argue with my companions over the quality of the wine.\n\nThe journey has been long, and I am weary, but the prospect of rest here is a pleasure. I think of you and the boys in Berlin, and I hope this trip will restore my health so that I may return to my work with renewed vigor. Give my love to Karl and Immanuel.\n\nYour affectionate husband,\nG. W. F."}}],"created":1795218998,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":230,"prompt_tokens":950,"total_tokens":1180,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-cv62qxgqB74z2MsmLxhT9hib7jAHi21F","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":950,"prompt_ms":971.435,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0225631578947367,"prompt_per_second":977.9347048438651,"predicted_n":230,"predicted_ms":5469.497,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.884266375545852,"predicted_per_second":41.868566707322444}}